Z||000009||AusFiero||08-22-2001||03:20 AM||||My friend took the pics of the ones in the holding yard. I was one of the Aussies that canncelled on that trip because I was building my new house. Yes they have been crushed. Jim Mattison was over in Aus for our Pontiac nats at easter. He was the one who told us of there demise. There may still be a red one floating around somewhere. If so Pontiac is tight lipped about it.<P>My friend is still searching for the large pictures of the prototypes and there may be some interior shots amongs them. I am pretty sure he showed me some when he originally took them.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
